
====================================================================================================
[0] SETUP
====================================================================================================
operator: zero-momentum F^2 density, i.e. the per-time-slice spatial plaquette sum
          S(t) (run3/b01 'lev0 raw', normalised /3) -- same carrier as GP3-PLATEAU.
estimator: periodic autocorrelator of run3_apebase.correlators (verbatim),
           delete-one-block jackknife, nb=20.
dictionary: the finite-volume counterpart of the cylinder horizon L is the maximal
           temporal separation Lt/2 (torus); c is arbitrary in P (quantifier AAd>=0),
           so the O(1) factor 2 in 'L <-> Lt/2' only relabels c.
scale invariance: R(t)=c(2t)/c(t)^2 is invariant under C -> lambda C, so the
           normalisation of the operator cancels exactly.

