[5] the SAME inequality on the TORUS (cosh geometry) is forced too  [T]
====================================================================================================
torus: C(tau) = sum_n w_n cosh(m_n(Lt/2-tau))/cosh(m_n Lt/2),  w_n>=0.
each cosh mode has log C convex in tau on [0,Lt/2]; a nonneg sum of log-convex
functions is log-convex (Hoelder) => c(2t)>=c(t)^2/c(0) holds for ALL w_n>=0.
